auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Pooled (series, team, PT, bucket) records (1197), EARLY G1-2 / MID G3-4 / LATE G5-7, min 10 poss, min 3 series.\n- observed_verdict: null\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-068", "score": 0.095, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-068 | Study family SF-CHT-068: CHA 2025-26 PNR matched-excess outlier\n- observed_research_question: CHA 2025-26 PNR matched-excess outlier\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: Charlotte is a real multi-year PNR suppressor (and a star-hunting offensive victim) in the league table.\n- observed_result: CHA defense +0.366 n=14, 95% CI [+0.161, +0.572]; 2025-26 n=5 mean +0.681; pre-2025-26 ~+0.19 across 9 pairs. Top 3 games 54% of excess mass. Offense +0.480 n=17, not LaMelo-centered (Nurkic/Oubre/Smith/Knueppel).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Defense cell is a five-game 2025-26 stretch; pre-2025-26 ordinary. Do not tell Dean Charlotte is a real PNR suppressor.\n- observed_sample_and_power: defense n=14 (5 in 2025-26)\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: high (1.0)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-034", "score": 0.089, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-034 | Study family SF-APPA-034: Opponent-relative leverage prevalence sweep\n- observed_research_question: Opponent-relative leverage prevalence sweep\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: How often does an opponent-specific exploitable defensive weakness exist?\n- observed_result: Exploit available 33.3%; trap 23.3%; both 6.7%; neither 50.0%; median best edge 3.79%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_sample_and_power: 870 pairs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: 870 ordered team pairs; defense PT edge vs league >= +5% on seed PTs.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: Edges depend only on the defense (e.g. DAL PNR +9.2% for every offense), so they are not matchup-specific.\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-068\n- auto_uses_dataset: DS:NCAA_tournament_and_ratings_data"}], "n_results": 4}

Stage 2. Using the retrieval result above (follow-up tools are allowed within the tool budget), complete steps 4 to 9
and reply with the final action. Output schema (all fields required):
{
